as </span><span begin="00:28.870" end="00:31.060">blues</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.650" end="00:35.320"><span begin="00:32.650" end="00:32.980">But </span><span begin="00:32.980" end="00:33.280">through </span><span begin="00:33.280" end="00:33.790">all </span><span begin="00:33.790" end="00:33.850">the </span><span begin="00:33.850" end="00:35.320">sorrow</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.320" end="00:38.440"><span begin="00:35.320" end="00:35.620">We've </span><span begin="00:35.620" end="00:35.770">been </span><span begin="00:35.770" end="00:36.220">riding </span><span begin="00:36.220" end="00:38.440">high</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.090" end="00:42.520"><span begin="00:40.090" end="00:40.480">And </span><span begin="00:40.480" end="00:40.540">the </span><span begin="00:40.540" end="00:40.930">truth </span><span begin="00:40.930" end="00:41.080">of </span><span begin="00:41.080" end="00:41.200">the </span><span begin="00:41.200" end="00:41.860">matter </span><span begin="00:41.860" end="00:42.520">is</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.520" end="00:47.290"><span begin="00:42.520" end="00:42.730">I </span><span begin="00:42.730" end="00:43.150">never </span><span begin="00:43.150" end="00:43.600">let </span><span begin="00:43.600" end="00:43.810">you </span><span begin="00:43.810" end="00:44.740">go </span><span begin="00:44.740" end="00:44.830">let </span><span begin="00:44.830" end="00:45.640">you </span><span begin="00:45.640" end="00:47.290">go</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.320" end="00:49.810"><span begin="00:47.320" end="00:47.770">We </span><span begin="00:47.770" end="00:47.860">were </span><span begin="00:47.860" end="00:48.490">scanning </span><span begin="00:48.490" end="00:48.580">the </span><span begin="00:48.580" end="00:49.810">cities</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.840" end="00:53.140"><span begin="00:49.840" end="00:50.320">Rocking </span><span begin="00:50.320" end="00:50.500">to </span><span begin="00:50.500" end="00:50.830">pay </span><span begin="00:50.830" end="00:51.040">their </span><span begin="00:51.040" end="00:53.140">dues</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.850" end="00:57.400"><span begin="00:54.850" end="00:55.150">But </span><span begin="00:55.150" end="00:55.750">besides </span><span begin="00:55.750" end="00:55.900">all </span><span begin="00:55.900" end="00:56.020">the </span><span begin="00:56.020" end="00:57.400">glamor</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.430" end="01:00.640"><span begin="00:57.430" end="00:57.730">All </span><span begin="00:57.730" end="00:57.910">we </span><span begin="00:57.910" end="00:58.210">got </span><span begin="00:58.210" end="00:58.420">was </span><span begin="00:58.420" end="01:00.640">bruised</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.230" end="01:04.870"><span begin="01:02.230" end="01:02.500">But </span><span begin="01:02.500" end="01:02.830">through </span><span begin="01:02.830" end="01:03.340">all </span><span begin="01:03.340" end="01:03.400">the </span><span begin="01:03.400" end="01:04.870">sorrow</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.870" end="01:08.020"><span begin="01:04.870" end="01:05.170">We've </span><span begin="01:05.170" end="01:05.290">been </span><span begin="01:05.290" end="01:05.770">riding </span><span begin="01:05.770" end="01:08.020">high</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.610" end="01:12.070"><span begin="01:09.610" end="01:09.970">And </span><span begin="01:09.970" end="01:10.060">the </span><span begin="01:10.060" end="01:10.480">truth </span><span begin="01:10.480" end="01:10.660">of </span><span begin="01:10.660" end="01:10.750">the </span><span begin="01:10.750" end="01:11.380">matter </span><span begin="01:11.380" end="01:12.070">is</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.070" end="01:17.620"><span begin="01:12.070" end="01:12.460">I </span><span begin="01:12.460" end="01:12.670">never </span><span begin="01:12.670" end="01:13.150">let </span><span be